Package: ks3fs-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic | linux-headers, ktls-utils
Description: in-kernel S3 object store filesystem (DKMS)
 ks3fs mounts an S3-compatible bucket as a filesystem without FUSE: reads
 and writes go through the page cache, large files are stored with
 multipart uploads, and TLS uses the kernel's TLS with tlshd.
 .
 This package builds the module with DKMS for every installed kernel and
 ships the mount.ks3fs helper (DNS names, keyring credentials).
